  "description": "The Kinesis RTD is the ultimate transcontinental endurance road bike frameset. RTD by name, Race the Distance by nature.Our premium-quality aluminium endurance road bike frameset is designed to be ridden fast across cities, counties, or continents, living up to its moniker by racing the whole distance, whether that's to work, on the Sunday club run, or even The Transcontinental Race.The RTD's geometry has been carefully refined to allow responsive yet stable handling in all situations, even when fully loaded for your next adventure, and when it comes to sizing, our Rider Fit Geometry ensures a perfect bike fit.The Kinesis RTD is the ultimate Scandium all-conditions, four-season endurance race bike frameset, making it ideal for British summer and winter weather, the perfect all-conditions all-journeys bike.\nGuyKesTV",
